OL,3,GNEWSASchool to admit girls for first
OL,4,Atime in 474 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public school will admit girls for
OL,7,Fthe first time since it was founded in
OL,8,F1552.
OL,10,FThe Harpur Trust, which has managed
OL,11,FBedford School since 1764, said it
OL,12,Fwould become co-educational from
OL,13,FSeptember 2027 as part of an investment
OL,14,Fit will make in its schools over the
OL,15,Fnext 12 months.
OL,17,FPlans also include upgraded facilities
OL,18,Fat Bedford Girls' School, campus
OL,19,Fimprovements at Bedford Modern School
OL,20,Fand expanded childcare funding at
OL,21,FPilgrims Pre-Preparatory School.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
